Error [E0905]: `NotComparable` isn't `Comparable`
  --> generic_call_diagnostics_cover_arity_and_bound_failures_2.jet:6:14
    |
  6 |     value :: choose<NotComparable>(NotComparable{ value: 1 })
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: `NotComparable` would need to implement `Comparable` before it can be used here
 Fix: Write `#Comparable` before `NotComparable`, or use `sort_by` with a key
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0905
